# ─── Rust build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────
/target/
Cargo.lock.bak
**/*.rs.bk

# ─── Frontend build / cache ───────────────────────────────────────
/web/node_modules/
/web/dist/
/web/.vite/

/.pnpm-store/
**/.pnpm-debug.log*
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
# tsc incremental compilation cache + generated declarations
**/*.tsbuildinfo
/web/vite.config.js
/web/vite.config.d.ts

# ─── Local workspace state (these are PER-USER workspaces, not source) ─
# Ignore everything under .maestro/ EXCEPT learning proposals, which are meant
# to be reviewed (and optionally committed) as a diff. NOTE: a trailing-slash
# `/.maestro/` cannot be re-included with a `!` negation — the `/.maestro/*`
# form is required for `!/.maestro/proposals/` to take effect.
/.maestro/*
!/.maestro/proposals/
/.maestro/bench/cache/
/.maestro/bench/runs/
/.mux/
/.claude/
/.cursor/
/.codegraph/

# ─── Runtime / generated artefacts ────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.log.tmp
**/.DS_Store
/plans/*.report.md

# ─── Editor / IDE local files ─────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ─── Env / secrets — never commit ─────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.yaml
credentials.json

# ─── Generated, local-only ────────────────────────────────────────
# Understand-Anything knowledge graph: regenerate with `/understand`. It's
# large, LLM-generated, and drifts from the code, so it stays local — the
# native code-graph indexer is the zero-config default when it's absent.
/.understand-anything/

# ─── Local maintenance scratchpads ────────────────────────────────
/docs/design/
/fix-codex-desktop-state.sh
/assets/icon-concepts/
/maestro-design-archive/
/maestro-demo/
# QA "experience cycle" run captures — regenerated by scripts/run-t1-cycle.sh.
# Transient and machine-specific (absolute paths), so they stay local. The
# narrative case docs (docs/cases/*.md) are kept; only the run dumps are ignored.
/docs/cases/*-runs/
# Local runtime state (sqlite + stream store).
/data/
